Subject: [PATCH] Transcription progress, live updates and notifications

One shared poller follows queued and running jobs (GET /api/jobs?active=1, every 2.5 s while a job
runs, 15 s otherwise). The recording page and the preview show a progress panel (step, bar, percent,
time elapsed, time remaining, Cancel); list rows show Not transcribed, Queued, Transcribing 42% or
Failed with Retry. When a job ends, lists, counts, collections and open pages reload on their own and
the bell gets a count and a list (transcript ready, failed, imported). On the desktop app the taskbar
button shows progress, the tray tooltip shows the recording, percent and time left, and a Windows
notification (official Tauri notification plugin) says when a transcription ends while OpenPlod is in
the background. The Processing jobs list in Settings follows along without Refresh. Adds French text
for these strings and for the local pipeline settings from patch 12.
---
